## 13. Pull Request Process

1. Ensure all tests pass
2. Update documentation if necessary
3. Add or update examples if applicable
4. Ensure bundle size impact is minimal
5. Request review from at least one maintainer

---

## 14. Release Process

* Semantic versioning (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)
* Generate changelogs automatically from commit messages
* Create GitHub releases with detailed release notes
* Publish packages to npm with proper tags

---

